<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES FIRM TO $3.487 BLN - FEB 12.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES FIRM TO $3.487 BLN - FEB 12.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia</p>
<p>(NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves firmed to</p>
<p>$3.487 billion as of February 12, from $3.428 billion on</p>
<p>February 5.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES  Feb 12   Feb 5   Jan 29  Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)    3.487    3.428    3.418    3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	 1.920    1.933    1.920    2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector  5.407    5.362    5.338    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
